      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '7-7-26 Gavin Notes


    Please press any button and wait for the player
    join message to appear, then select Monster 1. After this selection, you may
    choose where to load in the monster.


    QA Focus: animations, damage, and
    full destruction


    Changes were made to Beastdome regarding scale and placement
    of backdrop to accommodate new destruction camera. Because of this and the notes
    about its effects, the tilting stage hazard has been removed from the list temporarily.
    Monsterberry probably won''t be worth testing this build because of its lack
    of hazards. Destruction cam currently has no support for when players jump off
    edges'
